WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.460
If you take a bamboo seed and water it, nothing happens.

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:10.460
Even if you water it for one, two, three, four years, nothing happens.

3
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.460
Most people give up.

4
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.460
"Bamboo seed is dead!

5
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.460
Move on!"

6
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.460
But guess what?

7
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.460
In the fifth gear, boom!

8
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:25.460
The bamboo seed shoots up 24 meters in six weeks all at once.

9
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.460
And here is the secret.

10
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:34.460
It was always growing, but it was growing roots underground that you can't see.

11
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.460
Life works the same way.

12
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.770
Your startup, relationship, money, social media followers, they don't grow in a

13
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.460
straight line.

14
00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:47.460
Sometimes it feels like nothing happens for years.

15
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.460
But remember, you are building roots.

16
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.460
So no matter what, keep watering.

17
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.460
Your bamboo moment is about to come.
